{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"maxIssuerNumber","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:5Adyen0A15ActionComponentC13ConfigurationV5TwintV15maxIssuerNumberSivp","role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/AdyenActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/Twint-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"E.g. pass 39, if you listed all schemes from “twint-issuer1” up to and including “twint-issuer39”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The value is clamped between 0 and 39.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these